{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(｡･ω･｡)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、番組のロケに行ってきたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/21/dvc00339.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょこっと出てるお尻は\"れなりん\"です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いからしっぽ描いてみた(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日付が変わっていよいよ明日大阪です！\nほんっとに楽しみヽ(´∀｀*)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに会って握手して私たちを知って貰うことが一番！ですが、大阪と言うことは…本場のタコ焼き！を食べることも楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タコ焼きをお腹いっぱい食べてみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マヨネーズをたっぷりかけてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいくつか質問がきてるのでちょっと答えていきます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○好きなキャラクターは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなキャラクターは…たくさんありますよ！\nディズニーだったらミニーちゃん、ドナル